{
 "title": "A Fool's Mercy",
 "intro": "Moon Faire. Two minutes in the night square: the Jester, all ten of her moves, and Envoi's lost souls. Every light, spell and sound is made in code, timed to her real frames.",
 "footer": "<p>The square, its lamps and the cut-outs she walks behind are Envoi's night square (envoi-on-the-longest-night). The wisps, the Shadow Wraith and the great wraith are cut from Envoi's model and action sheets. The opening shot is the moonrise still from 20-min. The Jester's frames come from the Flip Book Art export, drawn on their anchors and played at the speeds Chris chose. All music and sound is synthesized in the browser.</p><p>Arrow keys skip 5 seconds. Space plays and pauses.</p>",
 "out": "dist/jester-square.html",
